  "solution": "Let's check each option,\n\n** 1. ÷ and ×**\n\n**→ 24 + 120 × 8 ÷ 16 – 48 = 36**\n\n**→ 24 +120 × 0.5 – 48 = 36**\n\n**→ 24 + 60 – 48 = 36**\n\n**→ 84 – 48 = 36 **\n\n**→ LHS = RHS.**\n\n \n• **× and –**\n\n→ 24 + 120 ÷ 8 – 16 × 48 = 36\n\n→ 24 + 15 – 768 = 36\n\n→ 39 - 768 ≠ 36\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS.\n\n \n• **– and +**\n\n→ 24 - 120 ÷ 8 × 16 + 48 = 36\n\n→ 24 - 15 × 16 + 48 = 36\n\n→ 24 - 240 + 48 ≠ 36\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS.\n\n \n• **÷ and –**\n\n→ 24 + 120 – 8 × 16 ÷ 48 = 36\n\n→ 24 + 120 - 2.66 = 36\n\n→ 24 + 117.33 ≠ 36\n\n → LHS ≠ RHS.\n\nThis is also incorrect.\n\n**Hence, the correct answer is \"Option 1\".**",
